### Document question — SSE streaming (`text/event-stream`)
### Read the body as SSE: each event is one line `data: <json>`. Types: meta, delta, complete, error (`type` field).
### Use fetch + ReadableStream (or similar); EventSource cannot send Authorization headers unless proxied.

POST http://localhost:8001/api/document-question/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer user_token_123

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "human",
      "content": "Hablame sobre un Avión de caza"
    }
  ]
}


